      "message": "The set of tags being in sync between what\u0027s provided to generateKey() and what appears in the attestation record makes sense, I think.\n\nHowever... I just noticed that the AIDL spec currently has \"Tag::EC_CURVE must be provided to generate an ECDSA key.\"\n\nIf that\u0027s true, there\u0027s a couple of dozen tests that need to be modified, which will need to be a separate change (basically remove the AuthorizationSetBuilder\u0026 EcdsaSigningKey(uint32_t key_size) overload and fix everything that breaks).",
