      "message": "It seems super odd to me that we don\u0027t specify the curve.\n\nWe\u0027re ok for now, because only NIST P-curves are supported (based on the EcCurve enum). However, I could totally see us expanding this in the future to support other curves, at which point relying solely on the key size is going to be a problem.",
